                <pb facs="0309" n="216" sameAs="frus:frus1935v04/pg216"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/2497: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Dawson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-09-17T09:00:00-05:00">September 17, 1935—9
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 1:05 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>81. Chamber of Representatives yesterday approved Rio de Janeiro protocol in
                    decisive second reading by a vote of 95 to 4.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
